**Root cause:** Docker was installed on the Kali box. Docker rewrites the `FORWARD` chain to a default-deny policy and inserts its own chains ahead of everything else to isolate container traffic — silently breaking any manual IP forwarding for non-container traffic, including this MITM setup.

